Robotweax SRT provides a namespaced CMake package:

    find_package(RobotweaxSRT CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE RobotweaxSRT::srt)

For static linking, use CXX as the consumer linker language.
Headers remain #include <srt/srt.h> through the target's include path.
This port does not replace libsrt or select Robotweax in other ports.
Only load one SRT implementation into an application process.
